# Oversized Full-Chip & Macro Gate-Level Netlists (> 35 MB each; GitHub 100 MB limit)
# Note: All 36 Yosys synthesis logs (synth_*.log), PPA_SUMMARY.md, ppa_metrics.json,
# and all 24 Core IP gate-level netlists (<= 13 MB each, used by Stage 15 Gate-Level
# Formal Equivalence Miters) ARE tracked in git.
# Run `make synth` to regenerate these 12 macro netlists locally using Yosys 0.60.
synth/mlu_tfu_fractal_mac_asap7_netlist.v
synth/mlu_tfu_fractal_mac_sky130_netlist.v
synth/mlu_vfu_sfu_pipe_asap7_netlist.v
